# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/baratella2024.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: the DeePMD potential (attention-based embedding,
# embedding 40-80-160, fitting 3 x 320, 7 A cutoff) for Ge, GeTe and
# Ge2Te trained iteratively on 115,000 CP2K configurations of liquid,
# amorphous and crystalline phases; the overall energy, force and virial
# RMSEs. Structural, dynamical and crystallization results are
# properties.

